<title>USA: Lear, other stocks recommended - Barron's.</title>
<headline>Lear, other stocks recommended - Barron's.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lear Corp and other stocks were recommended by Barbara Marcin, senior equity portfolio manager at Citibank Global Asset Management, Barron's reported.</p>
<p>Marcin said Lear now makes a broad range of parts components for the car, in addition to the seating components that it used to focus on exclusively.</p>
<p>Lear's shares closed Thursday down 1/8, at 42-7/8.</p>
<p>Other stocks Marcin recommended include:  </p>
<p>Tower Automotive Inc</p>
<p>Santa Fe International Corp</p>
<p>Global Marine Inc</p>
<p>Allstate Corp</p>
<p>Travelers Group Inc</p>
<p>Everest Reinsurance Holdings Inc</p>
<p>Student Loan Marketing Association</p>
<p>Franklin Resources Inc</p>
<p>McDonald's Corp</p>
<p>AT&amp;T Corp</p>
<p>Martin Marietta Materials Inc</p>
